# Graphify + Spec Kit first

If `graphify-out/graph.json` is missing, run `graphify update .` before exploring.
If `.specify/` is missing, run
`specify init . --here --force --non-interactive --integration cursor-agent`.
Then follow `.specify/memory/constitution.md` and `.cursor/skills/speckit-*`.
